Korea’s perspective on public diplomacy (Hoyoun Koh, Nazarvayev University, Kazakhstan)  
Moderator: Jungyeop Woo (Sejong Institute) 
Discussants: Wooyeal Paik (Yonsei University), Jung-mi Cha (Yonsei University), Youngjoon Kim (INSS), June Park (American University of Beirut) 
