Erin joined the Ensemble Outreach Team in August 2017. As an Outreach officer 
she responds to user helpdesk queries, teaches workshops on how to use 
Ensembl and related resources, and contributes to website help pages and social 
media. Before joining EMBL-EBI she completed a PhD in fungal-plant interactions 
at the University of York, where she also studied to become an Associate fellow of 
the Higher Education Academy (AFHEA), qualified in adult education.
