BWR2017_Call for Abstract_Dec2016.pdf,2016년 12월 20일 08시 00분 00초,,21311,"Dear Colleagues, 
 
We are excited to announce the 2nd International Conference on Biological Waste as Resource 2017 
(BWR2017) to be held on 25–28 May 2017 (Thursday–Sunday) at the Hong Kong Polytechnic 
University, Hong Kong.  
 
It is our great pleasure to have the following Plenary Speakers (in alphabetical order) sharing their 
vibrant research and visions with us.  
 
Prof. Jacob de Boer (Editor-in-Chief, Chemosphere)  
 
Prof. Jiri Klemes (Editor-in-Chief, Journal of Cleaner Production)  
 
Prof. Xiang-dong Li (Hong Kong Polytechnic University)  
 
Prof. Xiao-yan Li (University of Hong Kong)  
 
Prof. Irene M.C. Lo (Hong Kong University of Science and Technology)  
 
Prof. Ashok Pandey (Editor-in-Chief, Bioresource Technology)  
 
Prof. Chi Sun Poon (Hong Kong Polytechnic University)  
 
Prof. Jonathan W.C. Wong (Hong Kong Baptist University)  
 
Prof. Ming Hung Wong (Editor-in-Chief, Environmental Geochemistry and Health) 
 
We are also honoured to present the Elsevier Author Workshop, where the Editor-in-Chiefs of the 
high-impact journals will offer valuable advice on the preparation and submission of manuscripts. 
Special Issues will be arranged in the environmental science and engineering journals. We will 
announce the details later. 
 
The conference themes embrace a wide range of emerging areas in the treatment and management of 
biological waste, deliberating the advances in technological development and policy making. 
 
Food/organic waste recycling and biomass valorization  
 
Agricultural waste processing and recycling  
 
Biochar/compost production and application  
 
Waterworks/sewage/industrial sludge treatment and recycling  
 
Life cycle assessment and cost-benefit analysis on biological waste management  
 
Environmental impact and toxicity/risk assessment of recycling and recovery practices  
 
Fate of PPCPs, EDCs, POPs, heavy metals, and nanoparticles in waste/wastewater treatment 
processes and the environment  
 
We are delighted to offer an early bird discount for online registration and payment before 31 
March 2017 (https://goo.gl/forms/lOLsQvui5QmB4WDB3). You are cordially invited to submit a 
one-page abstract for the oral or poster presentation. Please follow the format in the attached template 
and send the abstract to bwr2017@polyu.edu.hk before 28 February 2017.  
 
For more information, please see the attached poster and flyer, or visit our webpage 
www.bwr2017.com (available from 15 December 2016). Please do not hesitate to contact us through 
email bwr2017@polyu.edu.hk if you have any enquiries. 
 
We are looking forward to meeting you in Hong Kong next year! 
 
Best Wishes, 
 
Daniel C.W. Tsang (Conference Chair, Hong Kong Polytechnic University) 
