주관: 강원대학교석재복합건설신소재센터
•
Topics include advanced asphalt materials and technologies, hot, warm and cold-mix material 
characterization, modified binders, new testing and construction technologies, new equipment, 
asphalt recycle, pavement design and other asphalt pavement-related subjects.   
ATAP 2014
7th Announcement 
한국도로학회주최제13차국제심포지엄
Advanced Technologies in Asphalt Pavements (ATAP) is held on 25th Sept. 2014. Since 1996 when 
the first symposium was hosted in Korea, there have been more than 180 peer-reviewed papers 
presented in last 12 Symposiums.  Selected papers will be recommended as technical papers in 
the international journals,  “Road Materials and Pavement Design,” and Journal of Highway 
Engineering after peer-review.
