Conference 초청장.pdf,2012년 11월 13일 08시 00분 00초,,20112,"International Conference 2012
Advances in Natural Products Science  
and Development of Natural Medicine
November 20, 2012
Biomedical Science Building B501
Organized by
Institute of Bioscience & Biotechnology
College of Biomedical Science
Nutraceutical Bio Brain Korea 21 Project Corp
LINC (Leaders in Industry-university Cooperation)
Kangwon National University, Chunchon, KOREA
Invitation
A variety of medical professionals - including primary 
care physicians, acupuncturists, related allopathic 
providers, naturopaths, chiropractors, and other 
practitioners - utilize botanical medicine in their daily 
work with patients. Many pharmaceutical companies 
are also trying to develop new drugs from numerous 
herbal species.
Training and research in herbal medicine, scope of 
natural products science, and ranges of herb usages in 
the treatment of disease are variable among health care 
providers and drug manufacturers.
Isolation and utilization of useful chemical compounds 
from diverse organisms including plants, insects, and 
microbes through bio-technological application are 
very essential for comprehending the biological 
effectiveness of the natural products and developing 
new drugs. 
It is towardly for us to organize an international 
conference on the advances in natural products science 
and development of natural medicine. We hope to 
share each other scientific knowledge and information 
obtained from recent researches of the invited 
scientists. 
  
Directors, IBB · NB-BK21 · LINC
Dean, College of Biomedical Science
Kangwon National University, Korea
